  "description": "Na Hana and Song Duri are an online couple who have spent five years together exclusively through a video game. But the moment they finally meet in real life, they realize their feelings are not quite at the same temperature and break up at lightning speed! Then why do their hearts still race even after the breakup? Their emotions belong on EXchange, but their dating experience is firmly at “single since birth.” And so begins their painful yet delightful second quest for pure love: Pure Love Quest, Again. This summer, can Hana and Duri become each other’s one and only?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=852275), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14435263)",
